# Jirina Kudro's ETB makes a token per Count$TotalCommanderCastFromCommandZone
# (Player.getTotalCommanderCast). No card in this game is a commander -- there is
# no Commander setup -- so the count is 0, Java's own answer for a game without
# commanders, and the trigger resolves making no token rather than refusing.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
